# no auditor is careless; some engineers are careless; so some engineers are not auditors
atom	auditor(x)	x is an auditor
atom	careless(x)	x is careless
atom	engineer(x)	x is an engineer
P1	S1	all x: auditor(x) -> !careless(x)
P2	S2	some x: engineer(x) & careless(x)
C	S3	some x: engineer(x) & !auditor(x)
